@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
participant "DSH\nAgent Loop" as loop
participant "Model Adapter\n主备切换插件" as router
participant "DeepSeek Adapter\n主模型 Pro" as primary
participant "DeepSeek Adapter\n备用模型 Flash" as backup
loop -> router : 同一条已组装请求\nmessages / tools / signal
router -> primary : 首次尝试
alt 尚未转发片段，收到可切换错误
  primary --> router : finish: error\nSERVER / HTTP 503
  router -> router : 检查错误代码\n检查取消信号
  router -> backup : 同一请求，替换 provider / model
  backup --> router : 回答片段
  router --> loop : 逐段转发
  backup --> router : finish: stop 或 error
  router --> loop : 结束，不再尝试第三次
else 已经转发片段，随后断开
  primary --> router : 正文片段
  router --> loop : 立即转发，标记 committed
  primary --> router : finish: error\nTRANSPORT
  router --> loop : 保留错误，不调用备用
end
note over loop,router
AUTH / INVALID_REQUEST / 用户取消也不切换。
主备配置均走同一个官方 Adapter 服务；
图按两个具体模型区分请求，非两个服务实例。
end note
@enduml
